  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisquit.host%252fen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a071a84cf75714bde606769f94930a500df439c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"234\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6796f635427d805892e795802d37a6d6c836f982_0.webp\" width=\"790\" height=\"197\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/67b836ff6a4bc450de7c2e9e97f4a4b2923203e9.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>此模組為 LegendControl 的模組，但模組本身亦可獨立運作。</li>\n<li>此模組用以保護傳說寶可夢不被其他玩家竊取，並在此提供玩家間的信任系統。</li>\n<li>支援連接 Discord Webhook 以接收通知。</li>\n<li>全面自訂模組設定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0d70e2cc512728b8549087c31904cd8762598b46.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>傳說寶可夢出現時將完全受到保護，免受所有玩家干擾；導致其出現的玩家將在一段時間後移除保護。</li>\n<li>玩家可以將其他玩家加入信任名單，以便共同捕獲。</li>\n<li>保護到期時會觸發多種通知。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fx9gXu0j.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/482efee63d63b446e8828876572322cce2f8a42a.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"40\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpixelmon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd6fee0cd0acd3bc9f007bca6648552ce47c2dd8_0.webp\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fextralib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7797661bf0defeb0d3eb387785d7f3e43ef341bc_0.webp\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>",
